      "description": {
        "en": "The GT20 is a 3-in-1 robot vacuum and mop with LDS SLAM navigation, 5000Pa suction and 120–150 minutes of runtime. It sweeps and mops with a 220ml dustbin and 230ml water tank, supports App control (Tuya) and voice control (Alexa / Google Assistant), and offers smart mapping, no-go zones and virtual walls, obstacle avoidance and auto recharge. OEM/ODM customisation available for colour, voltage and plug type. Certification documents on file.",
        "zh": "GT20 是扫拖一体的三合一扫地机器人，采用 LDS SLAM 激光导航，吸力 5000Pa，续航 120–150 分钟。220ml 尘盒 + 230ml 水箱，支持 APP（涂鸦）与语音控制（Alexa / Google），具备智能建图、禁区与虚拟墙、越障避让、自动回充等功能。支持 OEM/ODM 定制颜色、电压与插头规格，认证资料已备案。"
      },
